WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Every time you start a new chat… you start over.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Everything you told it. Gone.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.200
What if it never ended?

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:21.100
Nova is one conversation. It keeps going for months, and it remembers what matters.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:26.200
Ask once. It works on its own computer… while you get on with your day.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:32.800
Side questions branch off… without losing your place.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:37.900
And before anything it can't undo… it asks you.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:42.000
Your assistant. Already on it.
